{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港吸煙與健康委員會聯同建造業界推出計劃，協助地盤工人戒煙。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">委員會下午舉行啟動禮，衞生署、勞工處都有派員出席，委員會指為配合地盤全面禁煙法例，會到各地盤及工程項目，即場評估工人吸煙情況，並提供為期6個月度身訂造戒煙輔導。委員會期望能透過計劃，降低地盤吸煙率。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SMOKING-1600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Se4wvow4KT1787217071.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SMOKING-1600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T09:20:37.933200+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}